# Reclaimer is drawn after LED discards at turn-1 priority. Its warp cost {2}{W} is paid with Plains and Sol Ring:
# X is 3 (its ruling), not 5. Basalt Monolith (mana value 3) is exactly the boundary and is returned; the Door of Destinies
# (mana value 4) cannot be targeted, and nor can a Mountain (a land card) or a Lightning Bolt (not a permanent card).
# The Diamond itself, in the graveyard too, is legal. At the beginning of the next end step the warped Astelli Reclaimer is exiled.

